size 640 352
; The tower in front of the mountains, painted in the article path syntax
; (ARTICLE.md section 6) plus scene.py's @circle, @ellipse and ; comments.
; Units are screen units: the figure fills the top 352 of the screen's 480.
; Painted back to front. The character and the occluders are not here:
; they are the vector display's (painted-test.c).
